    "title": "2026 Team Preview: The Punxsutawney Chucks - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Willie McGonigle ,\n1 days ago “We graduated over 80% of our offensive production in 2025. We will need to find new production from our skill players to complement our returning lineman. Defensively, we will have some new faces in some key spots, we will need those guys to catch on quickly for 2026. We return all state junior kicker Owen Roken, but need to replace our long snapper and holder to enable Owen to be the special teams weapon that he is. Read full article",
